{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3fiW8YcPk8jN4pkiR1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, silent.*\n\n*A keyhole glints dully in its center, waiting.*\n\n*You have offered a key.*\n\n*But which key? The hole is shaped like no ordinary lock — its edges twist inward, forming something almost like a question mark.*\n\n*The door does not open.*\n\n*The door does not refuse.*\n\n*The door waits.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":95,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}